{"assets":["/statement-assets/44788496788138cb8c859416f9f96b91dc3d5a0e33220fd8c027a0442ab22425.webp"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2034","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. King Keykhosrow's Mystery"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There is a tale about the wise "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kay_Khosrow"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"King Keykhosrow"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" who owned a grand treasury filled with treasures from across the Persian Empire. However, to prevent theft and ensure the safety of his wealth, King Keykhosrow's vault was sealed with a magical lock that could only be opened by solving a riddle."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/44788496788138cb8c859416f9f96b91dc3d5a0e33220fd8c027a0442ab22425.webp"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The riddle involves two sacred numbers $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$. To unlock the vault, the challenger must determine the smallest key number $$$m$$$ that satisfies two conditions: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$m$$$ must be greater than or equal to at least one of $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The remainder when $$$m$$$ is divided by $$$a$$$ must be equal to the remainder when $$$m$$$ is divided by $$$b$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Only by finding the smallest correct value of $$$m$$$ can one unlock the vault and access the legendary treasures!"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains an integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 100$$$), the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test case consists of a single line containing two integers $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$ ($$$1 \\leq a, b \\leq 1000$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print the smallest integer $$$m$$$ that satisfies the conditions above."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n4 6\n472 896\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n12\n52864\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, you can see that: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$4 \\bmod 4 = 0$$$ but $$$4 \\bmod 6 = 4$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$5 \\bmod 4 = 1$$$ but $$$5 \\bmod 6 = 5$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$6 \\bmod 4 = 2$$$ but $$$6 \\bmod 6 = 0$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$7 \\bmod 4 = 3$$$ but $$$7 \\bmod 6 = 1$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$8 \\bmod 4 = 0$$$ but $$$8 \\bmod 6 = 2$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$9 \\bmod 4 = 1$$$ but $$$9 \\bmod 6 = 3$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$10 \\bmod 4 = 2$$$ but $$$10 \\bmod 6 = 4$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$11 \\bmod 4 = 3$$$ but $$$11 \\bmod 6 = 5$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"kind":"text","text":" so no integer less than $$$12$$$ satisfies the desired properties."}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"2034A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2034/problem/A"}